  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Measures - Cooperation Facility for Bangladesh - Twinning: Strategic Partnership of Bangladesh&apos;s Supreme Audit Institution (SAI) with EU SAI(s)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This twinning of the Office of the Comptroller and Auditor-General (OCAG) in Bangladesh with a Supreme Audit Institution (SAI) in a Member State (MS) of the European Union (EU) or a consortium of EU MSs SAIs aims at supporting OCAG to bring the quality of its Financial Audits, Performance Audits and Information Technology (IT) Audits up to international standards. OCAG will benefit from a resident advisor that will set up regular exchanges between the institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
